==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Znache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can rush this stage with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], as well as other rushers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to destroy the base in under a minute before any of the more notable threats spawn.

Bring Starting Money [[Cat Combo]]s (i.e. [[Offshore Accounts (Combo)|Offshore Accounts]] and [[Bento Special (Combo)|Bento Special]]) and kill the opening Sinner Snaches with [[Talents|Talented]] Can Can Cat or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] for Extra Money. Then, summon Awakened Bahamut Cat to destroy the base and claim your win. Sinner Snache Death Surges may be troublesome, so make sure to time Bahamut accordingly.

